    "answer": {
      "short": "$42.4\\text{ in}^{2}$",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\nr &= 12\\div2=6\\text{ in}\\\\\nA_{\\text{whole}} &= \\pi r^{2}\\\\\nA_{\\text{whole}} &= \\pi(6)^{2}\\\\\nA_{\\text{whole}} &= 36\\pi\\text{ in}^{2}\\\\\nA_{\\text{eaten}} &= \\frac{3}{8}A_{\\text{whole}}\\\\\nA_{\\text{eaten}} &= \\frac{3}{8}\\times36\\pi\\\\\nA_{\\text{eaten}} &= \\frac{27\\pi}{2}\\text{ in}^{2}\\\\\nA_{\\text{eaten}} &\\approx 42.4\\text{ in}^{2}\n\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
